 "message": "Congratulations to you and your partner! \ud83c\udf89\n\nUnder POL-PAR-01, birth, adoptive and foster parents with at least 6 months of service get 16 weeks of fully paid parental leave. You've been with us since January 2022, so you qualify for the 16-week entitlement. The leave must be taken within 12 months of the child's arrival.\n\nThe policy also asks that you tell HR at least 30 days before the leave starts, when possible. For a early-February placement, that means letting HR know as soon as you have a confirmed date.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-PAR-01"
 ]
